-| AutoEQ | `assets/autoeq/`, `lib/services/autoeq_catalog_service.dart`, `lib/features/settings/equalizer_screen.dart` |
-| Logging | `lib/core/logging/`, `rust/src/api/log.rs`, `lib/features/settings/screens/logs_screen.dart` |
